{"id":"638585","name":"汉堡","author":"雪玥美食家","authorId":"12929721","desc":"","cover":"images/638585/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"汉堡坯","amount":"6个"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"3个"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"半个"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"奥尔良","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡胸肉从中间片开。","img":"images/638585/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加洋葱，姜。","img":"images/638585/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"生抽，蚝油，奥尔良，盐。","img":"images/638585/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再打一个鸡蛋。","img":"images/638585/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"抓匀腌制一小时。","img":"images/638585/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面粉。","img":"images/638585/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淀粉，比例1：1。","img":"images/638585/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加小苏打。","img":"images/638585/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盐，拌匀。","img":"images/638585/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"沾一层配好的炸粉，沾一层水。","img":"images/638585/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"在沾一次炸粉，在沾一层水。","img":"images/638585/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后在沾一层炸粉，抖出鱼鳞状。","img":"images/638585/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"油温五成热，下锅炸。","img":"images/638585/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"炸好成品。","img":"images/638585/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"汉堡坯180度烤三分钟，加生菜，加炸好的肉。","img":"images/638585/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"配上沙拉酱。","img":"images/638585/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"省事又省力又简单，非常好吃的汉堡就好了。","img":"images/638585/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱、不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}